  title: "==>",
  command: "==>",
  content: {
    blocks: [
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "the wall blows inward. A wall of fire fills the frame."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>The wall blows inward, and for a split second the whole corridor is nothing but light.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "the fire passing where Kinoh was a heartbeat ago. She is mid-dive, sideways, wide-eyed and delighted."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>You throw yourself sideways without deciding to. The fire goes past you and takes everything it touches.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>Halvard, a few steps behind you, isn’t so lucky.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "the corridor, glowing and smoking. Kinoh on the floor, singed, with nothing on."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>Your prison garments are gone, all of them, burnt to ash in an instant. Your fur is crispy at the edges, and you smell like burnt dough.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>It seems you managed to escape mostly unharmed.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "a silhouette of ash where Halvard stood. Below it, a pair of spotless boots."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>The rest of Halvard is nothing but a burning memory now. His boots are perfectly fine though!</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "Kinoh staring at the boots. Beside them, an iron sword lies in the ash, untouched next to a very damaged tough leather belt."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>An iron sword clatters at your feet. It’s Halvard’s, and it came through without a scratch.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "next",
        page: 7
      }
    ]
  },
